c/wisconsin/sauk-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Sauk County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 48% of normal in September to October and 52% in October to November. Grid 28060 had its driest year in 1958 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
